flowchart LR
  subgraph WIN[Windows 11 PC — manually started]
    START[Start server.bat] --> API[FastAPI HTTP server]
    SCAN[Media scanner] --> DB[(SQLite catalog)]
    FILES[(Approved local MP4 files)] --> API
    POSTERS[(Poster JPEG/PNG)] --> API
    DB --> API
    START --> SCAN
  end
  subgraph LAN[Trusted LAN]
    ROUTER[Router / switch / Wi-Fi]
  end
  subgraph TV[Roku SceneGraph client]
    SETTINGS[Saved manual IP + port] --> CONNECT[Connection manager]
    CONNECT --> GRID[Poster grid + details]
    GRID --> PLAYER[Video node]
    SEEK[15-second seek controller] --> PLAYER
    HUD[On-screen controls] --> SEEK
    EQ[EQ presets — FUTURE / NOT IMPLEMENTED]
  end
  API <-->|HTTP JSON / poster images / MP4 byte ranges| ROUTER
  ROUTER <--> CONNECT
  ROUTER --> GRID
  ROUTER --> PLAYER
